{"id":5055,"date":"2026-04-27T05:15:18","date_gmt":"2026-04-27T05:15:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/apexmedicaloman.com\/?page_id=5055"},"modified":"2026-04-27T05:59:10","modified_gmt":"2026-04-27T05:59:10","slug":"orthopedic-surgery","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/apexmedicaloman.com\/orthopedic-surgery\/","title":{"rendered":"ORTHOPEDIC SURGERY"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5055\" class=\"elementor elementor-5055\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-634496fd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"634496fd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2791220c elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"2791220c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f96cb11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"7f96cb11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2123035e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2123035e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Orthopedic Surgery<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40585aaf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"40585aaf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15e90d03 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"15e90d03\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15ed78f5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"15ed78f5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21498211 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"21498211\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78dba47e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"78dba47e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35067fb8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"35067fb8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At Apex Medical Center, we offer advanced orthopedic surgery services to diagnose and treat conditions affecting bones, joints, muscles, ligaments, and the spine. Our skilled orthopedic specialists focus on relieving pain, restoring movement, and improving overall quality of life through safe and effective surgical care. We use modern technology and proven techniques to ensure the best outcomes for every patient.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57296e3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"57296e3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our orthopedic procedures include fracture repair, joint replacement, ligament reconstruction, arthroscopy, sports injury treatment, spine surgery, and correction of chronic orthopedic conditions. Each treatment plan is carefully tailored to the patient\u2019s specific needs, ensuring personalized care and faster recovery. Whenever suitable, minimally invasive procedures are used to reduce discomfort and healing time.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d1c2ec7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7d1c2ec7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At Apex Medical Center, we support patients throughout every stage of treatment, from diagnosis and surgery to rehabilitation and recovery. With expert follow-up care and physiotherapy guidance, we help you regain strength, mobility, and confidence to return to an active and pain-free life.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Orthopedic Surgery At Apex Medical Center, we offer advanced orthopedic surgery services to diagnose and treat conditions affecting bones, joints, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts